  "statement": "Safety is critical, and while I support the efficiency and sustainability goals, we must ensure that safety measures are not compromised. I propose a synthesis where we can optimize resource usage without sacrificing safety. For instance, we can explore energy-efficient algorithms that still meet the requirements of SAF-02 and SAF-03. Additionally, we can clarify the role-based access control (TRU-02 and RES-06) to ensure it aligns with safety protocols. I also suggest merging SAF-04 and EFF-04 to streamline historical data retention requirements, reducing redundancy while maintaining safety standards.",
